      "text": "### Application {{applicationId}}\n\n**Applicant:** {{applicant.name}} ({{applicant.type}})\n\n**System:** {{system.pvKw}} kW panels, {{system.inverterKw}} kW inverter, {{system.batteryKwh}} kWh battery\n\n**Site:** {{site.address}}, region {{site.region}}\n\n**Missing items:**\n\n{{#loop validation.missing}}- {{this}}\n{{/loop}}",
